Binary: linuxmuster-webui7
Built-For-Profiles: noudeb
Architecture: source all
Version: 7.4.14
Distribution: lmn74
Urgency: medium
Maintainer: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Changed-By: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Description:
 linuxmuster-webui7 - Next generation web-based management tool for linuxmuster.net v7.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-webui7 (7.4.14) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [security] [lmn_auth] The password is no longer kept after the
     login: only the linuxmuster-api token is retrieved, and it stays in
     the session worker. With two-factor authentication, the token was
     lost at the TOTP step and every request to linuxmuster-api failed
     with "api not available". Needs Ajenti 2.2.18.
   * [security] [lmn_auth] The sudo elevation is disabled.
   * [security] [lmn_users] Only the installed LaTeX templates can be
     used to print passwords, no arbitrary path.
   * [security] [lmn_wireguard] The wireguard endpoint is restricted to
     administrators.
   * [security] [lmn_device-manager] The route running arbitrary commands
     is removed, and the plugin is marked as deprecated.
   * [security] [lmn_websession] Session ids and BigBlueButton passwords
     are generated with secrets instead of random.
   * [lmn_linbo4] Deleting an image warns that its whole directory is
     removed, backups and files added by hand included.
   * [packaging] Requires Ajenti 2.2.18, core plugin 0.117 and settings
     plugin 0.36.
   * [packaging] Depends on linuxmuster-tools7 (>= 7.4.20).
